    "review.tempus.tempus.is.a.technology.company": "Tempus is a technology company advancing precision medicine through AI-powered genomic analysis and clinical data integration. Founded in 2015 by Eric Lefkofsky, Tempus has built the world's largest library of molecular and clinical data, partnering with over 7,000 physicians and 65% of US academic medical centers. The platform combines next-generation sequencing with machine learning to provide personalized cancer treatment recommendations based on each patient's unique molecular profile.",
